<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ford started at Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ford started at Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Ford Motor Co with ratings of near-term accumulate and long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Nicholas Lobaccaro said his earnings estimates are $1.90 per share for the second quarter and $5.00 per share for 1997.</p>
<p>-- 12-month target price is $42 per share, he said.</p>
<p>-- Ford shares rose 1/2 to 36-7/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
